---
// Ecosystem expansion & Roadmap section
---

<section class="sec" id="roadmap">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="split rev">
      <div class="col-stage">
        <div class="stage" data-stage="network" role="img" aria-label="A network with VJIT at the centre, linked to T-Hub, EdVenture Park and future campus chapters">
          <p class="cap">VJIT at the centre, links growing outward</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Ecosystem expansion</p>
        <h2 class="h2">From one campus to a network.</h2>
        <div class="phases">
          <article class="phase">
            <span class="n">1</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Flagship hub at VJIT Hyderabad</h3>
              <p>The operating model is built and tested here first: six verticals, live projects and a leadership chain.</p>
              <span class="st live">Live</span>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="phase">
            <span class="n">2</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Chapters on other campuses</h3>
              <p>New campuses copy the same six-vertical structure and plug into the shared project pipeline, with Marketing &amp; Outreach leading the onboarding.</p>
              <span class="st">Next</span>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="phase">
            <span class="n">3</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Alignment with the regional ecosystem</h3>
              <p>Strategic alignment with T-Hub Hyderabad and EdVenture Park, so chapter members meet the wider startup and innovation community early.</p>
              <span class="st">Building</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bodies">
      <article class="body-card panel">
        <h3>T-Hub Hyderabad</h3>
        <span class="mono">Startup ecosystem</span>
        <p>Gives Startup &amp; Investment a route to incubation, mentors and investor conversations for member ideas.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="body-card panel">
        <h3>EdVenture Park</h3>
        <span class="mono">Innovation body</span>
        <p>Gives student founders and chapter teams access to innovation programmes and a wider network of builders.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="fine">T-Hub Hyderabad and EdVenture Park are the ecosystem bodies the roadmap aligns with. Formal partnership terms will be listed here once confirmed.</p>
  </div>
</section>
